  "title": "Basic CDN site",
  "description": "A published static site on a CDN that serves files by path only (GitHub Pages): its routes, the commit it was built from, and its files as archive entries. Built from the renderable graphs its directory names, and deployed by the Tool its storage names.",
  "anyOf": [
